companion4soloplayer.core.creation.inputs.InputField -[hidden]down-> companion4soloplayer.core.creation.inputs.InputKind
companion4soloplayer.core.creation.inputs.InputKind -[hidden]down-> companion4soloplayer.core.creation.inputs.InputProvider
companion4soloplayer.core.creation.inputs.InputProvider -[hidden]down-> companion4soloplayer.core.creation.inputs.InvalidAnswerError
companion4soloplayer.core.creation.inputs.InvalidAnswerError -[hidden]down-> companion4soloplayer.core.creation.context.InvalidPathError
companion4soloplayer.core.creation.context.InvalidPathError -[hidden]down-> companion4soloplayer.core.creation.inputs.MappingInputProvider
